	(text "SERCOM Pin assignment bug\n\nSPI_DATA_SCK/MOSI\n- Doesn't match I/O pin requirement\n- SPI data transfer will use MOSI/SCK:PB16/PB17 (SERCOM5) until next revision. MISO: PB00(unconnected)\n\nUART_TX/RX\n- UART_TX requires SERCOM_PAD[0]\n- UART_RX will use PA10 (SERCOM0) until next revision\n- UART_TX will be set to PA08 (SERCOM0) untile next revision (unconnected)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 191.77 0)
